653	/**
654	 * Advances the game state machine one tick.
655	 *
656	 *   'menu'      — wait for Enter/Space → countdown
657	 *   'countdown' — tick down to 0 → racing
658	 *   'racing'    — raceTime increments; when playerFinished → finished
